\section{Frozen hypothesis and isolated change}
\textbf{Hypothesis.} \VAR{summary.hypothesis|latex}

Every arm retains the exact 3,611,849-parameter Fusion v2.5 architecture and
training objective. Only the learned correction to persistence is bounded:
\[
r_{\mathrm{raw}}=\delta_{\mathrm{deep}}+
\delta_{\mathrm{history\ shortcut}},\qquad
\widehat y=y_{\mathrm{latest}}+
\operatorname{clamp}(r_{\mathrm{raw}},-c,c).
\]
A cap of zero denotes the unchanged unbounded control. The positive bounds
0.20, 0.35, and 0.60 log10 \cn{} units bracket the previously logged
95th, 99th, and 99.9th absolute residual percentiles.

