\section{Limitations and next action}
This single-fold, single-seed screen cannot establish seasonal robustness,
instrument transfer, operational readiness, or a champion. A residual bound
is an engineering safety constraint, not a physical regime model. Only an arm
passing every frozen point, tail, probabilistic, provenance, and resource
condition could proceed to rolling robustness.

